    "title": "SEEN: NABA's 26th Annual Visionary Golf Tournament - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Timesunion.com ,\n11 hours ago Were you Seen at NABA’s 26th Annual Visionary Golf Tournament on Sept. 22, 2025, at Albany Country Club in Voorheesville? The Northeastern Association of the Blind at Albany’s (NABA) mission is to help blind or visually impaired individuals in our community achieve a life of independence and growth. The event was a fundraiser to support the organization’s mission. To help raise awareness, participants at the event were also able to experience a blind putting station.\nWere you Seen at the Northeastern Association of the Blind at Albany’s 26th Annual Visionary Golf Tournament on Sept. 22, 2025, at Albany Country Club in Voorheesville? (Courtesy of the Northeastern Association of the Blind at Albany ) Sign up for Times Union newsletters here\nRead the original article on timesunion.com",
